  "problem": "Dan purchased his land for $160$ thousand dollars. The value of the land increases by $10%$ each year. How much will Dan's plot be worth after $5$ years? Round your answer to the nearest thousand dollars.\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        After $5$ years, the land will be worth approximately \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n thousand dollars.",
